  "memoised": "memoised_best_us is best_us when every oracle query is distinct (distinct_queries == ell), where the four-way's compute_memo = compute - one_call * (ell - support) subtracts nothing; null otherwise",
  "probes": 9,
  "quantity": "C^O(x) evaluated directly: OracleCircuit::eval on x, the accepted label's four bits (the four-way's inst.x), against the frozen judge table, one SparseTableOracle lookup per oracle gate; the four-way harness's `compute` (\"naive\"). Per image the circuit, x and the table oracle are built as CertifiedSparseInstance::build_case builds them, without the rest of its Case (no R1CS, no witness Instance, no holographic index); case_setup_ms is that build's wall time, together with the de-oracled layout, loc and honest trace that trace_nu and distinct_queries are read from (files written before 2026-09-25 timed the whole build_case there, both index halves included where nu >= 15)",
